 r←Test_FindDeps_010(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;list;buff;pkgs;dir;res
⍝ Exercise FindDependencies with defaults on just a package name
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 r←T._Failed

 dir←∆GetTempDir ⍬
 res←TC.InstallPackages'HandleError'dir
 →T.GoToTidyUp'aplteam-HandleError-'{⍺≢(≢⍺)↑⍵}∊res

 list←##.Client.FindDependencies'IniFiles,HandleError,doesnotexist'dir
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≠≢list                                          ⍝ Just one URL
 T.GoToTidyUp 2≠≢1⊃list                                         ⍝ Hosts the "URL" and the list of hits
 →T.GoToTidyUp≢/F.NormalizePath¨dir(1 1⊃list)                   ⍝ Must match the right argument provided to FindDependencies
 →T.GoToTidyUp~0<≢1 2⊃list                                      ⍝ Must not be empty, of course
 buff←{⎕C⊃,/1↓⎕NPARTS ⍵}¨F.ListDirs dir                         ⍝ Get the package IDs from the paths
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1 1 0≢∨/¨∨/¨¨(⊂¨'inifiles' 'handleerror' 'doesnotexist')⍷¨¨⊂buff  ⍝ They all must turn up except "doesnotexist"...

 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 {}F.RmDirByForce dir
